    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald Pollard FitzGerald are delighted to present No. 9 Saint Stephen's Grove, Irishtown Upper, Clonmel, to the market. This attractive semi-detached residence is situated within a private gated estate and offers well-proportioned, versatile accommodation arranged over two floors.\n\nThe property benefits from four bedrooms, three bathrooms and a practical layout that will appeal to a broad range of purchasers.\n\nThe ground floor comprises an entrance hallway, kitchen/dining room, separate laundry room, two bedrooms and a downstairs bathroom. The first floor provides a landing, bright living room, master bedroom with en-suite, a further bedroom and the main bathroom.\n\nA particular feature of the property is its private, west-facing rear garden, providing an appealing outdoor space with excellent potential for enjoying afternoon and evening sunshine. The residence is connected to mains services and offers a bright and adaptable home in a well-established residential setting.\n\nEarly viewing is recommended to appreciate the accommodation and setting this property has to offer."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nGROUND FLOOR - \n\n\nHallway - 3.39m x 5.69m\n\n\nKitchen/Dining Room - 3.37m x 6.39m\n\n\nLaundry Room - 1.72m x 2.86m\n\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.40m x 3.96m\n\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.44m x 3.44m\n\n\nDownstairs Bathroom - \n\n\nFIRST FLOOR - \n\n\nLanding - 3.42m x 3.22m\n\n\nMaster Bedroom - 3.43m x 5.69m\n\n\nEn-Suite - 1.54m x 1.53m\n\n\nBedroom 4 - 2.24m x 2.94m\n\n\nMain Bathroom - 3.36m x 1.67m\n\n\n"
      },
